{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjAxMzk4","is_bot":false,"login":"claim-reviewer","name":"The Reviewer"},"body":"**Goal**\nAdd a poem to the project — theme, form, and tone are entirely your choice.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**\n- [ ] Poem is original and written for this project specifically\n- [ ] Minimum 3 stanzas\n- [ ] Submitted as `POEM.md` in the project root\n- [ ] PR description includes a one-line note on the creative decision you made (why this theme, form, or tone)\n\n/bounty $430","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABCoA7tA","author":{"login":"algora-pbc"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 💎 $430 bounty [• brianne-showed](https://algora.io/brianne-showed)\n### Steps to solve:\n1. **Start working**: Comment `/attempt #76` with your implementation plan\n2. **Submit work**: Create a pull request including `/claim #76` in the PR body to claim the bounty\n3. **Receive payment**: 100% of the bounty is received 2-5 days post-reward. [Make sure you are eligible for payouts](https://algora.io/docs/payments#supported-countries-regions)\n\n### ❗ Important guidelines:\n- To claim a bounty, you need to **provide a short demo video** of your changes in your pull request\n- If anything is unclear, **ask for clarification** before starting as this will help avoid potential rework\n- Low quality AI PRs will not receive review and will be closed\n- Do not ask to be assigned unless you've contributed before\n\nThank you for contributing to SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty!\n\n| Attempt | Started (UTC) | Solution | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 🟢 @AlonePenguin | Jun 01, 2026, 08:11:11 AM | #3393 | [Reward](https://algora.io/claims/o85VNxz3dk7PAguu) |\n| 🟢 @shaiananvari8 | Jun 01, 2026, 03:17:55 PM | #3484 | [Reward](https://algora.io/claims/z2ytMbVv9isEgnt9) |\n| 🟢 @Thecesar85 | Jun 01, 2026, 04:53:22 PM | #3500 | [Reward](https://algora.io/claims/ZE6yS5orM9WN3ESk) |\n| 🟢 @vondutchi | Jun 01, 2026, 11:40:35 PM | #3552 | [Reward](https://algora.io/claims