nzas)\n- Theme: FreelanceFlow platform's tech stack (JWT, TypeScript, Express, Zod, Stripe)\n- Each quatrain maps to a layer of the stack; final couplet captures the human connection\n- Submit as POEM.md in project root","createdAt":"2026-05-25T07:15:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4532325242","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABDiXzsw","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Approach\n\nI'll write an original poem with a **technology/creation** theme — exploring the relationship between code and craft. I'll use a structured free-verse form with consistent stanza length (4 lines each) to mirror the rhythm and predictability of well-written code. Tone: reflective, slightly wistful, celebrating the human impulse behind the machine.\n\n## Deliverables\n\n- `POEM.md` in project root (≥ 3 stanzas, original work)\n- PR description with a one-line creative-decision note\n\n## ETA\n\nWithin 24 hours of assignment.\n\n## Payout Address (Base)\n\n`0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658`","createdAt":"2026-05-25T07:17:06Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4532335539","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABDjEdlA","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Approach\n\nI'll write an original technical poem exploring **the lifecycle of an open-source contribution** — from issue to merge. Theme chosen because it directly honors the collaborative spirit of this project. Form: 4 stanzas, free verse with subtle rhyme, balancing technical imagery with human emotion.\n\n## Deliverables\n\n- `POEM.md` in project root (4 stanzas, original work)\n- PR description with one-line creative decision note\n\n## ETA\n\n~1 hour from assignment\n\n## Payout Address\n\n`0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658`","createdAt":"2026-05-25T09:13:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4533067156","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABDjO9iw","author":{"login":"alexgduarte"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add an original five-stanza POEM.md at the repository root using an observatory/star-chart metaphor for scoped work, review evidence, and payout handoff in FreelanceFlow. Scope stays limited to the requested Markdown poem, with /claim #76, a one-line creative note, and validation details in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-25T09:41:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4533239179","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABDmN7JA","author":{"login":"Zhenvip"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add an original root-level `POEM.md` with five short stanzas written for FreelanceFlow. Creative direction: a specification-and-coordinate metaphor for scope, proposal context, review evidence, escrowed milestone payment, and verifiable handoff. Scope stays limited to the requested Markdown file, with `/claim #76`, a one-line creative note, and validation details in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-25T18:30:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4536367908","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABDm2VyQ","author":{"login":"shams220"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: I will write an original technical poem about coding and open-source collaboration using free verse format.","createdAt":"2026-05-25T20:27:33Z","includesCrea