al root-level `POEM.md` with five compact stanzas written specifically for FreelanceFlow. Creative direction: a handshake-ledger poem tying briefs, scoped work, Zod validation, messaging, Stripe billing, reviews, and paid release into one verifiable handoff. Scope stays limited to the requested poem plus a short demo proof, with `/claim #76`, validation notes, and the creative note in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-27T04:41:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4551361771","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD1kTkg","author":{"login":"Mickey123123"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nI will add an original project-specific technical poem in `POEM.md`, keep it at 3+ stanzas, and include a one-line creative note plus `/claim #76` in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-27T07:36:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4552463250","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD1n3zg","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Approach\n\nI'll write an original poem exploring the theme of **\"building in the open\"** — the act of creating something and sharing it freely, which sits at the heart of open-source culture. I'll use a structured form (quatrains with alternating rhyme) to mirror the precision and rhythm of code, while the imagery bridges the digital and the human. Minimum 4 stanzas to exceed the requirement.\n\n## Deliverables\n\n- `POEM.md` in project root containing the original poem (4+ stanzas)\n- PR description with a one-line creative decision note explaining the theme/form choice\n\n## ETA\n\nWithin 24 hours of assignment.\n\n## Payout Address\n\n`0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658`","createdAt":"2026-05-27T07:45:33Z","in