 Proof → Feast → Code Eternal, mirroring the full bounty lifecycle\n\n### File\n\\^Gssets/poem/shrimp-bug-hunter.md\\\n\n### Wallet\nEVM: 0x21ceafc8cb2b2dcf808ec6552b15c4c7a88f1a44\n\n/claim #76","createdAt":"2026-05-27T23:21:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4559487187","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD8e5JQ","author":{"login":"bilbop1"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add an original project-specific `POEM.md` at the repository root with five short stanzas. Creative direction: a ledger poem for FreelanceFlow, following a job from brief to proposal, escrow, review, and payout so the form mirrors the marketplace handoff. I will keep the change scoped to the requested Markdown file and include `/claim #76`, a one-line creative note, and validation evidence in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T00:09:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4559714597","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD8622w","author":{"login":"fvlaconstancia-lang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original root-level POEM.md with five compact stanzas written specifically for FreelanceFlow. Creative direction: a verification ledger poem that follows a job from brief to proposal, review, merge, and payout, with a quiet technical tone. Scope stays limited to the requested Markdown poem, with /claim #76 and a one-line creative note in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T01:54:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4560172763","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD9At9g","author":{"login":"eibrahim"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original root-level `POEM.md` with five compact stanzas written specifically for FreelanceFlow. Creative direction: a release-table poem where brief, scope, validation, review, and payout become separate seats in one trusted handoff. I will keep the PR scoped to the requested Markdown poem, include `/claim #76`, and add a one-line creative note plus validation evidence.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T02:16:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4560268790","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD97QUQ","author":{"login":"Jorel97"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original root-level POEM.md with five stanzas written specifically for the FreelanceFlow marketplace. Creative direction: a quiet ledger poem that follows the workflow from brief to proposal, dashboard, review, and payout. I will keep the PR scoped to the requested Markdown file and include /claim #76 plus a one-line creative note and validation evidence.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T06:00:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4561227857","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD9_jog","author":{"login":"er1c-cartman"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original root-level `POEM.md` written specifically for the FreelanceFlow/security bounty project. Creative direction: a compact audit-table poem that follows a task from brief to tests, review, merge, and payout while keeping the change limited to the requested Markdown file plus validation/demo proof. I will include `/claim #76` and the one-line creative note in the PR body without posting payout details or secrets.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T06:16:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4561298338","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD-AthA","author":{"login":"er1c-cartman"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #76\n\nSubmitted PR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1054\n\nAdded an original root-level `POEM.md` titled `The Audit Table`, with five four-line stanzas about FreelanceFlow's brief/proposal/test/review/merge/payout workflow, plus a short no-secrets demo video at `demos/poem-demo.mp4`.\n\nVerification:\n- `python3` poem check: `poem_file=True stanzas=5 poem_lines=20` (title excluded)\n- `ffprobe demos/poem-demo.mp4`: H.264, 1280x720, 6 seconds\n- `git diff --cached --check` passed\n- `git diff --check origin/main..HEAD` passed after latest main merge\n- `npm test` attempted; it still fails on the existing upstream `node --test src/tests` path issue, unrelated to this poem/demo-only PR.\n\nNo payout address, private token, cookie, seed phrase, API key, or personal information is included in the PR or demo.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T06:19:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4561317252","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD-BTig","author":{"login":"wbo68410-lgtm"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #76\n\nImplemented in PR #1056: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1056\n\nAdded `POEM.md` at the project root with an original four-stanza poem written for this security-focused project. Creative decision: I used an audit-trail theme and steady quatrains to connect careful engineering with reviewable craft.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T06:21:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issue