\nSubmitting a second original poem with a different creative frame: a compact trust-and-verification piece centered on escrow, identity, and proof. It will be root `POEM.md`, minimum 3 stanzas, with `/claim #76` in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T09:34:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4562637184","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEAs5qw","author":{"login":"synistr"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original project-specific root-level `POEM.md` with five stanzas. Creative direction: a handoff-ledger poem following FreelanceFlow from brief and proposal through proof, review, payment, and completed work. I will keep the PR scoped to the requested poem plus a short no-secrets demo proof, with `/claim #76`, validation notes, and the one-line creative note in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T12:51:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4564138411","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABECj9OQ","author":{"login":"BaoYuanZi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I’m working on this and will submit a focused PR for issue #76.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T16:19:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4566089017","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABECz3UQ","author":{"login":""},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/bounty claim\n\nI will submit an original technical poem for this project. AI agent ready.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T16:54:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4566349649","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEGM8rQ","author":{"login":"xiajixi76-beep"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: Write an original 4-stanza poem titled \"Summer Code\" about developer youth, summer hackathon memories, and the bittersweet regret of growing apart. Will submit as POEM.md in project root.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T02:17:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4569906349","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABENNjXw","author":{"login":"keon0711"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original project-specific `POEM.md` at the repository root with five compact stanzas. Creative direction: a verification-room poem where scope, messages, tests, review, and payout move through one accountable handoff. I will keep the PR scoped to the requested Markdown poem plus a short no-secrets demo video, include `/claim #76`, a one-line creative note, and validation evidence.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T15:59:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4577256287","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABENoUwQ","author":{"login":"aiautotool"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original project-specific `POEM.md` at the repository root with five compact stanzas. Creative direction: a quiet \"handoff ledger\" poem where brief, proposal, message proof, review, and payout each become a checkpoint in FreelanceFlow. I will keep the PR scoped to the requested Markdown file, include `/claim #76`, and add a one-line creative note plus validation evidence in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T16:51:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4577694913","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABENuNqA","author":{"login":"nguyenduchuyhd"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add an original root-level POEM.md with five compact stanzas written specifically for FreelanceFlow. Creative direction: a changelog poem where each stanza is a release note for trust moving from brief to proof, review, merge, and payout. Scope stays limited to the requested poem plus lightweight validation/demo evidence, with /claim #76 and a one-line creative note in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T17:04:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4577791400","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEOdAcw","author":{"login":"aglichandrap"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I have written an original technical poem and submitted it as a PR.\n\n**Issue created:** #1702\n**PR:** #1703\n\n## The Poem: \"The Developer's Journey\"\n\nAn original poem that captures the developer experience through modern development practices:\n\n- The ritual of `git init` and first commits\n- The collaborative nature of open source\n- Tools we use daily (Git, Docker, npm)\n- The joy of debugging and testing\n- The community that makes it all possible\n\nThe poem is structured in stanzas representing different aspects of the developer lifecycle, from first line of code to open-source contribution.\n\n### Preview (First Stanza):\n\n> In the beginning, there was the prompt,\n> A blinking cursor, dark and damp,\n> With fingers poised above the keys,\n> We write the code that shapes our dreams.\n\nI have signed up and would like to claim this bounty. 📝","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:27:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4578558067","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEOk3BA","author":{"login":"Jorel97"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original root-level POEM.md with five compact stanzas written specifically for FreelanceFlow. Creative direction: a release-window poem where brief, proposal, escrow, review, and payout are timed handoffs in one calm deployment cadence. I will keep the PR scoped to the requested Markdown file, include /claim #76, a one-line creative note, validation evidence, and a short no-secrets demo video.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:42:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4578686724","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEQ96ZQ","author":{"login":"haocyan0723-code"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original root-level POEM.md with five compact stanzas. Creative direction: a dispatch-room poem for this project, following a task through scope, proof, review, merge, and payout. I will keep the PR limited to the requested poem and include /claim #76 plus a one-line creative note and validation details.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T01:40:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4581194341","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABERCsYw","author":{"login":"ZaerCompany"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nSubmitted PR #1749 with an original root-level `POEM.md`. The poem uses a ledger-loom theme to connect scoped work, review, merge, trust, and payout steps for this project. The PR includes `/claim #76`, five stanzas, and local validation notes.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T01:57:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4581272675","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEREHUQ","author":{"login":"luisalias007-cmyk"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-30T02:05:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4581295953","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEROaHg","author":{"login":"fennhelloworld"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'm working on this — submitted PR #1768 with an original 3-stanza technical poem.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T03:16:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4581464606","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABERQBaA","author":{"login":"tranha80"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### AI-Generated Solution Proposal\n\nI've analyzed the issue and drafted a solution. Below is the proposed solution.\n\n#### Solution Details:\n```\n```markdown\n# POEM.md\n\n## The Logic's Echo\n\nIn wires unseen, a pulse begins,\nNot born of flesh, nor human sins,\nBut sculpted thought, a coded art,\nThat beats within the system's heart.\nFrom binary dark, a whisper low,\nAcross the network, currents flow,\nEach byte a dream, a quest, a plea,\nTo build a new reality.\n\nWith structured grace, the servers hum,\nA quiet strength, where thoughts become\nEquations vast, decisions swift,\nAn endless, calculated gift.\nNo idle pause, no moment lost,\nEach intricate connection crossed,\nTo render form, to paint a scene,\nA digital, unseen machine.\n\nAnd though no poet's quill may trace\nThe silent beauty of this space,\nIts elegance, profound and deep,\nAwakens secrets held in sleep.\nFrom abstract thought to concrete deed,\nIt plants the answer, sows the seed,\nAn echo of the mind's grand quest,\nPutting human skill to the test.\n```\n\n**PR Description Note:**\n\"Creative decision: I chose 'The Logic's Echo' as the theme to explore the unseen, elegant processes and profound impact of technical systems on reality, utilizing free verse for a fluid, reflective tone.\"\n```\n\n#### Proposal Letter:\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am thrilled to submit my proposal for the `Technical Poem Generation and Content Creation` bounty. The unique opportunity to infuse creative expression into a technical project deeply resonates with my expertise as an experienced freelancer.\n\n**Understanding Your Vision:**\nI understand your need for an original poem, specifically crafted for your project, consisting of a minimum of three stanzas. The theme, form, and tone are left to my creative discretion, which I see as a fantastic canvas to deliver something truly unique and impactful. Furthermore, I will ensure the poem is submitted as `POEM.md` in the project root, accompanied by a concise one-line note in the PR description detailing my creative decisions.\n\n**Why I Am the Ideal Candidate:**\nAs a professional freelancer with a robust background in content creation and a keen appreciation for the intersection of logic and artistry, I am uniquely positioned to excel at this task. I pride myself on:\n*   **Originality:** Delivering content that is fresh, unique, and tailored specifically to the project's context.\n*   **Creative Versatility:** My ability to explore diverse themes, forms, and tones to best suit a given purpose, ensuring the final output is not just compliant but compelling.\n*   **Attention to Detail:** Meticulously adhering to all specified acceptance criteria, from stanza count to file format and accompanying documentation.\n*   **Reliable Execution:** Consistently delivering high-quality work within agreed timelines.\n\n**My Approach to Your Poem:**\nMy process will be thoughtful and iterative, designed to produce a piece that genuinely enhances your project:\n1.  **Conceptualization:** I will delve into potential themes that subtly bridge the gap between technical concepts and poetic beauty, perhaps exploring the elegance of code, the journey of data, or the silent hum of a system. My goal is to find a theme that offers depth and metaphoric richness.\n2.  **Form & Tone Selection:** Based on the chosen concept, I will select a poetic form and tone that best amplifies its message, aiming for an engaging and memorable read that adds a distinctive voice to your project.\n3.  **Drafting & Refinement:** I will meticulously craft the poem, ensuring it meets the minimum three-stanza requirement while focusing on originality, evocative language, and thematic coherence. The goal is to create a piece that is both technically inspired and aesthetically pleasing.\n4.  **Seamless Delivery:** The final poem will be delivered promptly as `POEM.md`. I will also include the required one-line note in the PR description, explaining the rationale behind my creative choices (theme, form, or tone), ensuring all acceptance criteria are met with precision.\n\n**Commitment to Timeliness:**\nGiven the nature of this creative task, I am confident I can deliver a high-quality, original poem ready for your review within **24-48 hours** of project commencement, ensuring swift integration into your project timeline.\n\nI am excited by the prospect of contributing my creative skills to your project and adding a unique artistic dimension. I am ready to begin immediately and look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Freelancer Name/Handle]\n\n---\n**Payment Link (USD):** [Pay via USD](https://www.sandbox.paypal.com/checkoutnow?token=fallback_mock_704710)\n*Please verify the solution and approve payment.*","createdAt":"2026-05-30T03:26:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4581491048","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABERs37A","author":{"login":"sodalone"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add one original 4-stanza poem as `POEM.md` in the project root. Creative decision: use a compact review-and-proof theme that fits the bounty workflow while keeping the tone reflective and project-specific.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T06:31:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4581963756","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABER8qYg","author":{"login":"tranha80"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the \"Technical Poem Generation and Content Creation\" bounty. As an experienced and professional freelancer, I thrive on projects that blend creativity with clear technical requirements, and this opportunity to infuse artistic expression into a technical project truly resonates with my skills.\n\nI understand the core goal is to contribute an original poem to your project, with complete freedom in choosing the theme, form, and tone. Furthermore, I am fully aware of and committed to meeting all the acceptance criteria: ensuring the poem is entirely original and crafted specifically for this project, comprises a minimum of three stanzas, will be delivered as `POEM.md` in the project root, and accompanied by a concise, insightful note on the creative decisions within the PR description.\n\nMy approach combines a deep appreciation for the structured beauty often found in technical domains with a passion for creative writing. I excel at distilling complex concepts or abstract ideas into engaging and accessible content. For this task, I will leverage my imaginative flair to craft a poem that not only meets your specifications but also adds a unique and memorable dimension to your project. Whether reflecting on the elegance of algorithms, the challenge of debugging, or the broader impact of technology, I am confident in delivering a piece that resonates.\n\nTo demonstrate my immediate understanding and capability, I have included a preliminary poem draft in the `solution_draft` section below. For this example, I chose to explore the theme of \"The Silent Symphony of Code\" using a structured quatrain form and a reflective, appreciative tone, aiming to highlight the unseen magic and logical structure of the digital world. This draft adheres to the minimum stanza requirement and provides a glimpse into the quality and thematic relevance you can expect.\n\nI am committed to delivering high-quality, original content promptly and precisely according to your guidelines. I am excited about the prospect of contributing to your project and am confident that my unique blend of technical understanding and creative writing skills makes me an ideal fit for this bounty.\n\nThank you for considering my proposal. I look forward to the opportunit","createdAt":"2026-05-30T08:11:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4582222434","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESJyfA","author":{"login":"attaboy11"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #76\n\nPlan: add an original root-level `POEM.md` written specifically for FreelanceFlow. Creative direction: a \"bill of materials for trust\" poem, where scope, evidence, review, payment, and reputation are treated like parts that must be inspected before work can ship. I will keep the PR scoped to the requested poem, include `/claim #76`, and put the one-line creative note plus validation in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T09:38:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76#issuecomment-4582437500","viewerDidAuthor":false},